and loitering teenagers.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.730
But proponents of the laws say

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.180
that they're about keeping
the sidewalks clear

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.720
so that people can get through.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:50.360
Still, sit down at your own peril.

